+// HCL (b1840, Path Finding spec_hcl_1110): a living mate whose claim byte carries a fight or coming code (ckind >= 4; brain_claims.cc
+// claim_code_x) keeps its last group claim, read within HCL_K rounds, in the team table (build_team), so a crew target is not read
